    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000qqxt](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000qqxt) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 589.068 depth occurred on Aug 26 2025 37km SE of Tuvuca. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -17.8642 longitude -178.5457. It impacted 801 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
